requesting cancel
cancel returned
inner defer
drop 30
outer defer
drop 31
case: stages early
requesting cancel
cancel returned
stage defer 0
case: stages late
requesting cancel
cancel returned
stage defer 1
stage defer 0
case: inflight
requesting cancel
cancel returned
drop 41
drop 40
case: latest
requesting cancel
cancel returned
latest n=2
case: consume
requesting cancel
cancel returned
finish 50
drop 50
drop 51
